Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Blogs|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Blogs|
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Blogs Entry With HTML
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And Blogs add Entry With HTML
		|entryContent||
		|entrySubtitle|Blogs Entry Subtitle|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Bold Type Italics|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	Then BlogsEntry view Entry
		|entryContentBold|Bold Type|
		|entryContentItalics|Italics|
		|entrySubtitle|Blogs Entry Subtitle|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
Scenario: Add Blogs Entry With Inline Image
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Add Entry
	And BlogsEntry add Title
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntry add Content With Inline Image
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|navTab|Upload Image|
		|uploadFileName|Document_1.jpg|
	And Pause at locator '1000'
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Blogs Page|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And BlogsEntry view Entry
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	Then BlogsEntry view Inline Image
		|uploadFileName|Document_1|
